<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8869] PartitionsExchangeOnDiscoveryHistoryOverflowTest hangs on TeamCity</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8869</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After introduction of ExhangeLatches, PartitionsExchangeOnDiscoveryHistoryOverflowTest  will hangs permanently.  In current implementation, ExchangeLatchManager retrieves alive nodes from discoveryCache with specific affinity topology version and fails because of a too short discovery history. This causes fail of exchange-worker and therefore NoOpFailureHandler leaves node in hanging state.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13168061">IGNITE-8869</key>
